        "language": "english",
        "review": "Short and sweet, probably about 2-3 hours to play everything. I don't care because it's all really good fluffy fun. \r\n\r\nJust the insane amount of technical work that went into making this as low latency as possible is worth a purchase on its own. Custom engine, audio exclusivity, WASAPI and ASIO support, custom definable audio buffers and even being able to choose the audio thread timing method. This is a dedication to audio technical excellence that I didn't know existed anymore, and this is all so your clicks show up just a little sooner and feel a little better.\r\n\r\nI like games with well-defined focused scope that deliver on everything they set out to do. That feels like a weird thing to call out, but you'll notice it here and feel how much it matters.",
